<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>These Terms of Service may be updated when necessary. Continued use of Jovér Bot after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>If you have questions about these Terms of Service, you may contact the Jovér Bot team through the official support server.</p>

